     A          R CHNEW
     A          H                           HLPARA(*RCD)
     A                                      HLPRCD(HCHNEW)
     A            NHDR          78A  O  1  2DSPATR(HI)
     A            NMSG          74A  O 21  3DSPATR(HI)
     A            NFK           78A  O 23  2COLOR(BLU)
