     A                                  6  3'Topic'
     A            NTOPC         50A  B  6 24CHECK(LC)
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  8  3'Everyone in the office can see the-
     A                                       room and join it.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R CHTOPS
     A          H                           HLPARA(*RCD)
     A                                      HLPRCD(HCHTOPS)
     A            THDR          78A  O  1  2DSPATR(HI)
     A            TMSG          74A  O 21  3DSPATR(HI)
     A            TFK           78A  O 23  2COLOR(BLU)
     A            TROOM         40A  O  3  3COLOR(WHT)
     A                                  5  3'New topic'
     A            TTOPC         50A  B  5 24CHECK(LC)
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  7  3'The room is moved to the top of th-
     A                                      e list, and everyone in it sees the-
     A                                       change.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HCHATSCR
     A                                  1  2'Help - Live chat'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'The screen shows the latest fourte-
     A                                      en lines of the conversation.'
     A                                  5  3'New lines appear by themselves whe-
     A                                      n they arrive.  Whatever you have t-
     A                                      yped'
     A                                  6  3'is kept, but the cursor goes back -
     A                                      to the start of the line, so press'
     A                                  7  3'End or Field Exit to carry on typi-
     A                                      ng.  Settings can turn this off, so-
     A                                       that'
     A                                  8  3'new lines only appear when you pre-
     A                                      ss F5.'
     A                                 10  3'Type what you want to say and pres-
     A                                      s Enter to send it.'
     A                                 11  3'F6 goes back to the room list.  F9-
     A                                       changes the topic of a group room.'
     A                                 12  3'F3 leaves the chat.'
     A                                 14  3'The first time you write to someon-
     A                                      e in a session they get a system'
     A                                 15  3'message telling them you are waiti-
     A                                      ng, in case they are not in the cha-
     A                                      t.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HCHLST
     A                                  1  2'Help - Live chat rooms'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Group rooms are open to everyone i-
     A                                      n the office.  The room whose topic'
     A                                  4  3'changed most recently is at the to-
     A                                      p, so you can see where people are.'
     A                                  6  3'Type 1 beside a room, or put the c-
     A                                      ursor on it, and press Enter to joi-
     A                                      n it.'
     A                                  7  3'Type 4 to delete a room you made. -
     A                                       Administrators can delete any room'
     A                                  8  3'except EVERYONE.  F6 makes a new r-
     A                                      oom and asks for its topic.'
     A                                 10  3'For a private chat, type a user ID-
     A                                       in Private chat with, or press F4 -
     A                                      to'
     A                                 11  3'pick someone.  They get a message -
     A                                      saying you are waiting.'
     A                                 12  3'F7 and F8 page backward and forwar-
     A                                      d through a long list.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HCHNEW
     A                                  1  2'Help - New room'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Give the room a one-word name and -
     A                                      a topic.  The room appears at the t-
     A                                      op'
     A                                  4  3'of the room list for everyone.  Yo-
     A                                      u join it straight away.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HCHTOPS
     A                                  1  2'Help - Room topic'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Type the new topic and press Enter-
     A                                      .  Everyone in the room sees a line'
     A                                  4  3'saying you changed it, and the roo-
     A                                      m moves to the top of the room list-
     A                                      .'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
